<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us about your disrupted journey from {!Case.Departure_City__c}&nbsp;on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I can assure you that on time departure, is as much a priority for us, as it is for you and we work hard to ensure your flight departs and arrives as close to schedule as possible. Occasionally, delays arise for reasons outside our control and on this occasion<b> -<i>there was a mechanical issue with the aircraft/the aircraft had to undergo an inspection due to birdstrike/lightening strike/the aircraft operating</i> QF {!Case.Flight_Number__c}&nbsp;<i>was delayed on its previous sector etc-</i>.</b></font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">While safety must always be our first priority, we do understand this delay impacted your experience with us.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If requesting compensation add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We sincerely regret this delay meant you missed your<b><i> -meeting/dinner/concert/planned accommodation/train etc-</i></b>&nbsp;but Qantas are unable to meet your request for compensation. What I am able to do is provide a letter outlining the circumstances of the delay, which will assist you to make a claim for your unexpected expenses through your travel insurance. Please let me know if you require this letter.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If providing goodwill due tier add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As a gesture of apology, I have credited {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}&nbsp;Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account. You can use the points towards flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas Wine, or a range of products from our online Qantas Store.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I can assure you that we are committed to improving our delay handling processes when unforeseen problems do occur, and feedback like yours plays an important role in this process. Your first-hand experience is vital to developing this aspect of our service, so we are grateful you took the time to let us know what happened.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We are putting every effort into minimising delays and I hope you’ll see the difference the next time you travel.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>